&lt;p data-prosemirror-content-type=&quot;node&quot; data-prosemirror-node-name=&quot;paragraph&quot; data-prosemirror-node-block=&quot;true&quot;&gt;Interest in enabling secure use of AI tools to drive efficiency, creativity, and impact internally&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p data-prosemirror-content-type=&quot;node&quot; data-prosemirror-node-name=&quot;paragraph&quot; data-prosemirror-node-block=&quot;true&quot; data-pm-slice=&quot;1 3 []&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-prosemirror-content-type=&quot;mark&quot; data-prosemirror-mark-name=&quot;strong&quot;&gt;Bonus points if you have:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul class=&quot;ak-ul&quot; data-prosemirror-content-type=&quot;node&quot; data-prosemirror-node-name=&quot;bulletList&quot; data-prosemirror-node-block=&quot;true&quot;&gt;
&lt;li data-prosemirror-content-type=&quot;node&quot; data-prosemirror-node-name=&quot;listItem&quot; data-prosemirror-node-block=&quot;true&quot;&gt;
&lt;p data-prosemirror-content-type=&quot;node&quot; data-prosemirror-node-name=&quot;paragraph&quot; data-prosemirror-node-block=&quot;true&quot;&gt;An interest in cryptography and its application in modern systems&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-prosemirror-content-type=&quot;node&quot; data-prosemirror-node-name=&quot;listItem&quot; data-prosemirror-node-block=&quot;true&quot;&gt;
&lt;p data-prosemirror-content-type=&quot;node&quot; data-prosemirror-node-name=&quot;paragraph&quot; data-prosemirror-node-block=&quot;true&quot;&gt;Experience in Identity and Access Management (IAM) frameworks and protocols (Passkeys, SAML, OAuth, SCIM, etc)&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
